<!--
   Backup rules for API 30 and below (data_extraction_rules.xml covers API 31+).

   Nothing has to be excluded. The optional PP-OCRv6 Medium model is no longer app data at all: it
   lives in Google Play's asset-pack storage and Gaten only reads it (ocr/PpOcrPack.kt), so the file
   this rule used to exclude — the in-app model directory of the removed downloader — is never
   written. What does stay app-owned is small and outside Android's backup by construction: the
   WaniKani token and its cache sit under noBackupFilesDir, which is never backed up or transferred.

   The file stays because the manifest points at it; an empty rules document means the platform's
   defaults, which is what this app wants.
-->
<full-backup-content />
